The Vauxhall Mokka Tech Line was a trim level available on the first generation Vauxhall Mokka (2012-2016). It was positioned as a value-oriented trim, particularly aimed at company car drivers, offering a high level of standard specification for a lower price. I will evaluate based on the specifications commonly found for the Tech Line trim from that era.

